<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Launch screen: the logo (vector PDF asset LaunchLogo) centred on #17110f, its side = 30 % of the
     screen's shorter side (min of the two width constraints below). LaunchPlaceholder.swift lays out
     the native placeholder over the web view with exactly the same rules, so the hand-over to the
     web boot animation has no visible change. -->
